{"text": "If you're streaming or uploading your recording, make sure your internet connection is stable and fast enough to handle the upload speed.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "562686a6fa664bb939b39404bc55a9f918ffda19"}
{"text": "**Set up your editing software**: If you're planning to edit your recording, make sure your editing software is set up correctly.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "9f27b7e7f5ba1cb015589f740cf7e129df5eba95"}
