{"text": "translation", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "dbf2883f7271c58e9253e8fe6a5ffcd530a3433f"}
{"text": ":  \"In the 19th century, the French Revolution", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f19208896fb7326764e59ec0939bf05d6bd82ed7"}
{"text": "was a turning point in the history of France.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "ca47db3aaf077efa55fdb8a1de0c372a93a855d9"}
{"text": "It marked the end of the Ancien Régime, the absolute monarchy, and the beginning of a new era of political and social change.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "19efc46116a8280f285913793af408ee54a8c314"}
{"text": "The Revolution was a complex and multifaceted event, involving various political, social, and economic factors.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "23b78ae30bca21c5fb4127cefa520062b99c0ea2"}
{"text": "Here are a few key points:  1.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "31a032843adc5cde64ef78ef7efe7177650ccafe"}
{"text": "**Causes of the Revolution**:", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "c3b1da430e3289e6d7f19f0e7b101291086752fd"}
{"text": "The Revolution was sparked by a combination of factors, including:    - **Economic Inequality**: The French economy was highly unequal, with a small elite of nobles and clergy enjoying vast wealth and power, while the majority of the population lived in poverty.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f0235c0ac936458dfead49d31dc4fe2e948ff275"}
{"text": "- **Political Corruption**: The monarchy was seen as corrupt and inefficient, with the king and his court living in luxury while the people suffered.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "0c3a86fe642865ae7bbdf3997984686e9b45fda7"}
{"text": "- **Ideological", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "248c8c7744013e4b7047a89d821771fd83854975"}
{"text": "Shifts**:", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "e234eb67b0bd681c3c3476f9d2e3694841e0b973"}
{"text": "The Enlightenment, a philosophical movement that emphasized reason, individual rights, and progress, had a significant impact", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "d5e1a3c4dbc4e81ef09d02384897016d35dd0bbe"}
{"text": "on the Revolution.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "1b0985c53e1194d41189dce010429146dbeb1c71"}
{"text": "- **Social Unrest**: The people's dissatisfaction with their living", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "fc7894017162a412ee41968be7e9be4008432642"}
{"text": "conditions and their lack of political representation led to widespread unrest and rebellion. 2.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "8fe21bc38a959589c7b7df2c85adf9384d5123a1"}
{"text": "**Key", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f9ee7b05b59c099a52e5aef6f94eb71a51e27e73"}
{"text": "Events**:", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "843f44e76770380946a27be032ce1f1ce9a3c5a9"}
{"text": "The Revolution saw several key events, including:", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "22245fbd0865b4170c9884e0e88acdbffb4c0bba"}
{"text": "- **Storming of the Bastille (14 July 1789)**: This event marked the beginning of", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "2c5af69ac98b906b9f3b405f618ae7453e57df5d"}
{"text": "the Revolution and is often considered the", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "e8724437ed0a28c24d361dddfaebf05439fa49b9"}
{"text": "start of the", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "77800ed54067e4ddbac0c66bd18877c131a2c2c0"}
{"text": "French Revolution.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "21613fdb1761fb8875859ce3437d76492ebc034f"}
{"text": "- **Establishment of the National", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "5b801dfeb5f9dc3c5e0cf661d2a84226e7ba30dc"}
{"text": "Assembly (1789)**: This body, composed of representatives of the three orders (nobility, clergy, and commoners),", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "0595709ff25520b015c9111a543d292a6a3aae55"}
{"text": "played a crucial role in the Revolution.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "083fccea5b10c9efe89b960cb199cd03a4a39b58"}
{"text": "- **Declaration of the Rights of Man and of the Citizen (1789)**: This document, inspired by the Enlightenment, established the principles of individual rights and equality before the law.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "9626d3abe5f4d839e59ab100248ce66e7cd02761"}
{"text": "- **Execution of the King (1793)**:", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "a54ded39cd744af79713094337dfe5b2c80fcece"}
{"text": "After the Revolution, King Louis XVI was tried and executed, marking the end of the monarchy. 3.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7cc3f7e7ff3be03a20bf2b53ee66246fab039086"}
{"text": "Aftermath**:", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7b238a2a381956da3078186fd4bc30d5a10935e8"}
{"text": "The Revolution had far-", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "d6758b1b32ff40e14ebea9662e8120625ab6b8da"}
{"text": "reaching consequences, including:    - **Establishment of the Republic**: The Revolution led to the establishment of the", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "735f2560908bc12b06f2db3588284239a765675c"}
{"text": "French Republic", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "ce874309bb1ef7520efc1878e1c7e5a8a99a0277"}
{"text": ", which lasted until the restoration of the monarchy in 1815.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7a9c8096c535b42fbfdaeb0a9de528b1807fb739"}
{"text": "- **Revolutionary Wars**: The Revolution and its aftermath saw a series of wars, including the", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "eb48351f487d6a259db77ac94b9b5e8ac37ce70b"}
{"text": "French Revolutionary Wars and the", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "eb37e79a487d86e23d6a9b5809954bda59bc95d7"}
{"text": "Napoleonic Wars", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "1f02971244683ae433b438dca4d70afe13d54b43"}
{"text": "- **Cultural and", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "ff026d2bc0d5d1923e742c7c05217f7cc86ea0a2"}
{"text": "Intellectual", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "9e5709e18a9cd0196fc7832ac5cccd8dbd3e7467"}
{"text": "Changes**", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "9930740439fd312ac7e919934d606dc9c25889ea"}
{"text": "The Revolution had a profound impact", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f91a282354fabdcf9d5610fa6c234a485d115bd4"}
{"text": "on French culture", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "062198af4fa47d9c16a8132a268e313030066ef8"}
{"text": "and intellectual life, leading to significant changes in art, literature, and philosophy. 4.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "730870272cb8e4f9a10d8988752f029bc917b9be"}
{"text": "**Legacy**: The French Revolution had a lasting impact on the world, influencing other revolutions and shaping the modern world.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "38bd5a6919d2512d9f1ba056f34fefa644ce7b27"}
{"text": "It is often considered the first modern revolution, marking the beginning of", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "8cbc4d4032dfefadd11e252172034a5d18f414da"}
{"text": "a new era in political and social history.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "a515e190a4ccbeb09d84a8ddc04a934b4e408908"}
{"text": "\"  This overview provides a basic understanding of the", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "2fb19afaef297297765732c3e06e4d781171aceb"}
{"text": "French", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "b8b84b351d3491bd7843a122256e0acd3e0cae25"}
