{"text": "Here's a breakdown of the term \"local\":", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "94b794558800b424eb0ffe4d35fa08dd1db9ca40"}
{"text": "- **Local** refers to something that is:", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "0f76cfb2f4f9192e368faf4ec916432880b61c52"}
{"text": "- **Nearby**:", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "e379a9b4fc4c5f185b8456cd43f6055e617c91dd"}
{"text": "In the immediate vicinity.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "a462f266e8289ace3df251c4191c25841f97661b"}
{"text": "- **Near**: Close to a particular place or person.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "4a14f49f9943bd57197395a038e03638669fe875"}
{"text": "- **Nearest**: The closest in proximity.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "49c6dadd7dd4fb199e243906b972dbc51e0eda9c"}
{"text": "- **Nearest to", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "653fa842d9c96c3c7dc6d91e3070f03994f600e6"}
{"text": "Closest to a particular thing or concept.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "b0df1000c12cf87e2a3efb7fda06cdde55a27944"}
{"text": "In the context of a location, \"local\" can refer to: - **Local government**: The government of a specific area or region.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "a72d2dec6f81c0eac0c33b68a8ee8b300241952a"}
{"text": "- **Local authority**: The administrative body of a local government.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "d34eb8ef35bf63bbd243e1af3f9c73ab1b047020"}
{"text": "- **Local council**: A local government body that deals", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "d3a7232a4c157c04ce0f551cbd4501684e353df7"}
{"text": "with", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "29f3bb6c6ae77ecd2d648ad83439dae9b91e9b68"}
{"text": "local issues.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "e5dee08e148025a7674d38abc7aaaaf22815c702"}
{"text": "- **Local area**: A specific geographical area, such as a town, village, or neighborhood.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f10c68442a6c414d5a6dd2044d2c17575e4a4fe4"}
{"text": "- **Local business**: A business", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "cb318c925daa8a0b3ea4b7da06a25d583acce69e"}
{"text": "that operates within a specific area.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "301f860ac25e8319e02b71da2ab76803f291d15b"}
{"text": "- **Local language**: A language that is spoken in a specific area or region.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "6b817546d8e249ee19f6794f20e6979391c85217"}
{"text": "In a broader sense, \"local\" can also refer to: - **Local time**: The time in a specific location.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "2e2224c50444d904f47678d9df6d706443f1689f"}
{"text": "- **Local weather**: The weather conditions in a specific area.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "15f0472dd366923cc311ec5211310e5e1c2420a3"}
{"text": "- **Local customs**: The customs and traditions of a specific community or region.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f8ab7598e5001fed7bde80b4cf13a125b225e475"}
{"text": "If you're looking for information", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "88644dc9664678c5b8324d9b6417a9ad57668ec4"}
{"text": "about a specific location or context, please provide more details so I can give you a more accurate response.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "8fa4272df75c78ded3febbbcaf7182128a1f3315"}
