{"text": "- A past time period  3.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7e9916ccd67d1b1d7da64e67ab130f5c8c9611a5"}
{"text": "**Passerelle**: This is a type of bridge or small roadway that connects two parts of a larger road or highway. 4.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "fddf83405f0cf468877927c9efbd95791aa2518b"}
