{"text": "We", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "befb7a17d4146fcec81bb3f1522b6b29eec94fff"}
{"text": "Donc il y a une petite vigilance.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "81f244318f5a2b323de9b91d369adbfade1f0145"}
