{"text": "Ok, je la visite.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "33eb9da1d3040d2b57cf79fefcc7319166b1173d"}
{"text": "Ok, j'avais...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f3182191c76c58840873db331106b4d145c08bff"}
{"text": "Madame Percher.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "6a5922e7b8b45e1828813a790f9b303e8b569681"}
