{"text": "me", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "8b9ef4343d41199d35b9a0d344b215fc782573bd"}
{"text": "Par contre, je pense que ça sera.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "64b8fb0fbbb77e807e65d8e55174f413876797bc"}
{"text": "Je dois...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "d834561138d792462854b87aa6e1331ef7f12e9e"}
{"text": "Farm.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "a3266ed8b9b2b0edf91da04af58f5646054c17d1"}
