{"text": "Vous vous proposez.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "53666a988629e51d616551dfdda6cf76b1d4371c"}
{"text": "en", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "eab4202899b07a8d99686f59230f93d7e6c28f40"}
{"text": "Donc vous allez bien.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "b59adb37e546c5e1e98ef7bfb2ddbb492ccf41a0"}
{"text": "J'entends, hein.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "497fa421f2145d01233e5b6e0f0c8ec8c4d0ee37"}
