{"text": "de vous redonner.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "e13b9f1b12ab5942ff867e9d2a4132e008099c43"}
{"text": "Je vais voir.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "03523a3677e0e370375ee61fe953923fa4d637aa"}
{"text": "Moi ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "c1c962aabef05306bd1deec06e152794d35a1b5f"}
{"text": "Donc ici,", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "b2b1cd97fa0feddd562d20da74bb0886ea6eda4a"}
{"text": "Ici, il y a une fissure.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "ee6159ebb9093e1a86835eb63373702172dfd9bd"}
{"text": "Alors, on voit...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "fdebe5d0dc1cd3216232c309f61b3199936fa54a"}
{"text": "Par mon BVC", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "119c3a24cebba2d0de5149ccc848714c0a1a8a36"}
{"text": "s.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7f0155d194dd8d0f6d72c3a1f33c19d45c8ca1dc"}
{"text": "The...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "b8ec9633011f9c2a1eca2c9eb1e41e8d59e32aea"}
{"text": "We will", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "4f2b4e6242d19fe141e9435d6565930e428d837d"}
{"text": "Je vois bien.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "04dbb41616be2bbab96e43c879aea071c51e63de"}
{"text": "Il y a encore", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "44e4ae57dd4afbb84e36dacad2f3d9f636f134ed"}
{"text": "Il n'y arrive pas.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "71535d8cbdae0a31228ba3cf1dd48e6acf0d323b"}
{"text": "Super", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "b9dd58b80bc7f96c98f0ff3ddebb325cc23ebd20"}
{"text": "Serais-je ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "598e5cb5be5699cf47578e15a5678e8c761b10d0"}
{"text": "tu rentrer", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "3fe0f2c7861e07aed365235d79b14c15fc1d5afe"}
{"text": ", madame ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "ba47d4ec72b37b31d98b9a7b1cb6bb2a6e7d4466"}
{"text": "Je vais te", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f6e29bb1ded6e93a35e8a8967791077f1893366a"}
{"text": "Molto.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f063e7d911f16396d2f74a25f69256c386b685e8"}
{"text": "La peinture a des...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "24f9ad0c9c329722d5261db42ffb39aa7202929f"}
{"text": "Je suis riche.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "30a8afaf33a0118f4153ef21d65f7c0eb4cf8e6b"}
{"text": "Et il est tombé malade.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "6772d56e0e92e65ab2d8db1d12674a24caa30363"}
{"text": "On en voit.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "1bb4a0a119719885d40b0f7308016b3e8738b26f"}
{"text": "Je m'y drole.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "9ae083d6360a6a31e7c9203c8290789e0d9a24ae"}
{"text": "Mais j'ai ça là.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "9e39b0c80118e4607902e7aeaa25caef8bd53922"}
{"text": "voir", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "5e66183dd07e6cfc82cb4aec86b5c6602468e6f6"}
{"text": "Et là, il y a de l'eau.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "342072ef20720685b4f726773e589ccbc567d3d8"}
{"text": "Mais ça, si.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "2d67fe72ef4a2c68a7fe98519059e96805b5fd69"}
{"text": "Si vous voulez...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "72aa124e9705e6d8e55c08398e594791052ca771"}
{"text": "Et là ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "3bad72e487acaf0c863e55ac8c23c8d83eb75697"}
{"text": "Ça ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "62642d1878d865a50fd495d50ab5f4cd3a2a9ece"}
{"text": "De temps en temps.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "05b59221f461d7c6e5e3a7dcbee810986d2c45df"}
{"text": "Si, si, j'ai vu ça.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "95d2ce469e5e130b14d53d66d7728ea2c6cee24d"}
{"text": "Ne", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "77a525f241953edc803a747b0dd12f2b9127b426"}
{"text": "valeur", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "84aabf614a187876b16e04a3c45ade7390a4f73b"}
{"text": "Bon, donc", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "217e5724a306e8c39220575494492fbcd42117f4"}
{"text": "On a vu", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "e66a2e520436b9475c1a98d04b4d3cab3158f707"}
{"text": "Ok, ça marche.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "2d5bb8e5cbb3625d7ed4338ba2e1711bbb26b814"}
{"text": ", on va aller vers la caméra.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "764fa88d810e06bacf0f9d437d226a1ea5a656a4"}
{"text": "On va vers la caméra, madame, c'est bon ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "65f96643d5902a706048e17942abfb753fe54d60"}
{"text": "Sûr ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "1427161c3a35b7f819eafac1f06064ced2877f8d"}
{"text": "Y'a d'...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "8e7b6e98c820952314d615d10adf9d6f1c38c66e"}
{"text": "Tu vois, tu m'en mets.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "49c58e4b9b44b6edf9ca47776c1009cf29a79ad9"}
{"text": "Enfin, des problèmes...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "ee0c612aaae288adf2274f66c498c5f4e6843892"}
{"text": "Oui, allez-y.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "22da4659ef5b84864208f3d8947125064412387d"}
{"text": "Woo", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "b98f909872ab9c9abe92968875bd989ad99e7c10"}
{"text": "hoo", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "858b9bb45b6bc89b0cd29dac2f8bcfb329bb4394"}
{"text": "que ça va être mitigant.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "1e4297fbb2508d7e59d58293d5f0dba615f14a95"}
{"text": "Voilà, photo là.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "dc432668e7b4cafb92f67a906e574914471f4e26"}
{"text": "Awee", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "8e64dcac6f6fadbd5b042586f3533a73f19212b4"}
{"text": "oo", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "3c81313e00510b5382fa97eb695496decc703f02"}
{"text": "Aucune.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "06086d8c223202b97686251d77cef939f2c5d101"}
{"text": "Je vais finir.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "76aa9ccf72ddafe846065ca18249d4485c2c3b1b"}
{"text": ", je range tout.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "a799aa4a7f40f3135e68f81a74accd3b1547f9a7"}
{"text": ", bah là...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "a4d9e6fe7243acd577e08469c552dedde6f75d45"}
{"text": "Vous", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "40c62f10b4b71d41383b4cbf6db6795a69042ea5"}
{"text": "Madame,", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "563091d669f652152ba7c905b0f12b405cb1bfc1"}
{"text": "si vous voulez.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "9e19eebe581bf884d05fdf6854aba3ca877f717a"}
{"text": "Ok, donc on s'en va.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "e1e4c14983832fb86e77473cf63dee1ed3963c14"}
{"text": "Et puis on va passer...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "5855ab9f20d85d30b6551d82d78f9990bad95cb3"}
{"text": "copier mon 5.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "60c4cc56b024143be7bbd9ff482dba9a6702a92a"}
{"text": "Plus ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "c8241e01e0e9f89555754eea893477b772079df4"}
{"text": "Il y a une fissure verticale.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "4d6c0bcde4f5a171c5093a07c024dec34a491dfa"}
{"text": "Calm.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7dcf732e38708e360cc9bc90b18a7f354a88c7e8"}
{"text": "On va voir...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7f3445290f813262944ff2d5da66e6e2424b7aa4"}
{"text": "Lequel ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "5fb34191e4acca4001d0211f1e6e66e1537abbe1"}
{"text": "C'est beau, hein ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "82e0aa979b02689816094327cfda0b0aceb5f574"}
{"text": "s", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "29ec69f608358546c2ed89787ae87b188574f557"}
{"text": "Ça continue ?", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "93bd56378bde39dd4c9b4f8620d630774362d44c"}
{"text": "Et alors,", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "17a9d77087514fb9a62f7b4e357f0644576f7057"}
{"text": "tu as le truc.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "db49b5e2a34787484b818628893abb3a6a4b5d2a"}
{"text": "Chien.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "0c5c5b7692840f5c9ae88329ebb7b4b79dcda2d2"}
{"text": "On va voir la maison.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "faad33f8a0a5aa768a3733c5ecea136181f235a0"}
{"text": "Vamos agora a Misona.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "006d6c28df545454efecabed5a1cbeba4457f975"}
{"text": "Au revoir madame.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "6b6fc0b187dc7ff44a1f07390cd19d9e2c4f25d8"}
{"text": "... Moi", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7a624caa65453b378180f73be2460f3601384add"}
{"text": "Et vous avez...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "d3a8ab363bf30124df2f7bc6d35848fd0aa3685c"}
{"text": "Je regarde le plan.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "b081dc0e6b22c58f3b17cb5eb9f2407af01227b6"}
{"text": ", on me prend en photo.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "7a165971319b5b2ca88d4500f978ad73b1a07ff8"}
{"text": "J'imaginais.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "4bf4367fe6e1a4be76378a789f47a5e29562c10c"}
{"text": "So", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "eab5e9e3f58cd07431f53ae0e7c0842e33667f14"}
{"text": "Oui, mais tu as vu mon...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "5f7e3cb4e3a92d576b59e9d5202817012505053f"}
{"text": "La finition de Madame", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "f14d809516b84486af31282ef5cc0f50b99e047b"}
{"text": "Il y aura...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "c91ebe0cfca393d39e2492cebf0d5220c8776548"}
{"text": "Mais il y a...", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "676fd12e3a4019aa865b2dd0b1a0adc845ca20d2"}
{"text": "En tout cas,", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "d475161098e61e933d710397f2885ef3056d02db"}
{"text": "Isso,", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "ff27a2d500c13ff84dfddbde2762a1ae8f2b344f"}
{"text": "quoi.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "a804114b2c6deae97d4a964dc7a8e78f0015b516"}
{"text": "Ici, quoi.", "source": "lang_non_fr", "sha1": "dc78dfdb4cb7f295c10a9af67aca1621599d634f"}
